      (^{:inst [P]} sign c priv drbg hash))))







^{:go/end 329} (go/func SignDeterministic "SignDeterministic signs a hash (which shall be the result of hashing a\nlarger message with the hash function H) using the private key, priv. If the\nhash is longer than the bit-length of the private key's curve order, the hash\nwill be truncated to that length. This applies Deterministic ECDSA as\nspecified in FIPS 186-5 and RFC 6979.\n" :type-params [^{:tag (Point P)} P ^hash/Hash H] [^{:tag (* (Curve P))} c ^{:tag (func [] [H])} h ^{:tag (* PrivateKey)} priv ^{:tag (slice byte)} hash] :results [(* Signature) error]
